{"title": "Travel to Moonrise Towers", "pageid": 4581, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Travel_to_Moonrise_Towers", "categories": ["Quests", "Main Quest"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chapter_2.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Chapter_2.webp/400px-Chapter_2.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Chapter_2.webp/600px-Chapter_2.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Chapter_2.webp/800px-Chapter_2.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Chapter_2.webp/400px-Chapter_2.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Chapter_2.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Travel to Moonrise Towers</b> is a sub-<a href=\"/wiki/Quest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quest\">Quest</a> part of <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One's</a> main quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_a_Cure\" title=\"Find a Cure\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find a Cure\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_a_Cure\" title=\"Find a Cure\">Find a Cure</a>. It can be initiated by talking to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/38px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/50px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/25px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/38px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/50px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/25px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">Minthara</a>, depending on the outcome of the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Refugees\" title=\"Save the Refugees\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save the Refugees\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Refugees\" title=\"Save the Refugees\">Save the Refugees</a>, after each branch's respective <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_Refugee_Celebration\" title=\"Tiefling Refugee Celebration\">celebration</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">Campsite</a>. \n</p>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span></h2>\n<p><i>Objectives and journal entries may vary pending player decisions and outcomes.</i>\n</p>\n<div class=\"toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.6;\">Find a way to Moonrise Towers.</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<ul><li><i>Read Halsin's diary</i>: We found a diary written by the druid Halsin. In it, he writes about the parasites originating in Moonrise Towers.</li>\n<li>Halsin believed that the parasites are coming from Moonrise Towers.</li>\n<li>Halsin said the parasite has been altered by the followers of the Absolute. If we want answers, we need to head to their base at Moonrise Towers.</li>\n<li>Halsin said that the illithid parasites had been altered by followers of the Absolute. If we want answers, we need to head to the cult's base at Moonrise Towers.</li>\n<li>A druid named Halsin said that the illithid parasites had been altered by followers of the Absolute. If we want answers, we need to head to the cult's base at Moonrise Towers.</li>\n<li>We learned of one way to get to Moonrise Towers: through the Underdark.</li>\n<li>We learned of two ways to get to Moonrise Towers: through the mountain pass or through the Underdark.</li>\n<li>Minthara has a creature in her service who can guide us to Moonrise Towers through the mountain pass.</li>\n<li>Minthara told us to go to Moonrise Towers - the heart of the Absolute's power. We might learn more about the parasite there.</li>\n<li>True Soul Nere spoke of Moonrise Towers, where someone called the General resides. If we want answers about our parasite, we need to head there.</li>\n<li>The Dream Visitor told us to go to Moonrise Towers. We might find answers there about our parasites.</li></ul>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"overflow:hidden;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.6;\">Quest Completed!</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\">\n<ul><li>We made it to the shadow-cursed lands. Moonrise Towers must lie at the heart of this blight.</li></ul>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span></h2>\n<p>The quest is divided into two subquests, reflective of the two paths to the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Travel_through_the_Mountain_Pass\" title=\"Travel through the Mountain Pass\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Travel through the Mountain Pass\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Travel_through_the_Mountain_Pass\" title=\"Travel through the Mountain Pass\">Travel through the Mountain Pass</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Travel_through_the_Underdark\" title=\"Travel through the Underdark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Travel through the Underdark\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Travel_through_the_Underdark\" title=\"Travel through the Underdark\">Travel through the Underdark</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/5/53/A-The_Plot_Thickens.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/A-The_Plot_Thickens.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>The Plot Thickens</dt>\n<dd>Leave Act I - for somewhere altogether darker.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div s